WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:10.033
"What's wrong, Sally?" Cora said.

2
00:00:10.034 --> 00:00:14.792
"I was protecting my egg case," Sally said.

3
00:00:14.793 --> 00:00:18.491
"But then a huge wave came.

4
00:00:18.492 --> 00:00:22.929
It swept away my egg case!"

5
00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:26.067
"That's terrible," Mo said.

6
00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:32.542
Sally bit her lip. "I lost my babies!"

7
00:00:32.543 --> 00:00:36.255
"Don't worry." Cora hugged her.

8
00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:39.586
"I can find your egg case."

9
00:00:39.587 --> 00:00:46.448
Mo nodded. "Cora is the best helper!"

10
00:00:46.449 --> 00:00:53.029
"Follow me," Cora said.

11
00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:58.588
Everyone swam to the compass.

12
00:00:58.589 --> 00:01:03.667
Cora shot her ink, and the shell opened.

13
00:01:03.668 --> 00:01:08.790
Inside, the picture showed a rocky cave.

14
00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:15.556
Sally's eyes went wide. "That's Riptide Cave."

15
00:01:15.557 --> 00:01:19.324
"What's Riptide Cave?" Mo asked.

16
00:01:19.325 --> 00:01:23.791
"It's a bad place," Sally whispered.

17
00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:27.366
"Why is it so bad?" Mo asked.

18
00:01:27.367 --> 00:01:32.137
"Some fish told me stories," Sally said.

19
00:01:32.138 --> 00:01:36.132
"Sometimes the cave pulls you in.

20
00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:39.604
Then you never come out again!"

21
00:01:39.605 --> 00:01:42.542
"What?" Mo said.

22
00:01:42.543 --> 00:01:45.650
"Don't worry, Mo," Cora said quickly.

23
00:01:45.651 --> 00:01:48.443
"Those are just stories.

24
00:01:48.444 --> 00:01:51.970
I'm sure we'll be fine."

25
00:01:51.971 --> 00:01:55.939
Suddenly the arrow took off. Whoosh!

26
00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:00.017
"Let's go!" Cora said.

27
00:02:00.018 --> 00:02:03.143
She and Sally started to swim.

28
00:02:03.144 --> 00:02:07.757
But Mo didn't follow them.

29
00:02:07.758 --> 00:02:11.150
"What's wrong?" Cora asked.

30
00:02:11.151 --> 00:02:17.939
Mo was shaking. "I'm . . . scared of that cave!"

